-- DarkChaos: item stats above level 80 onto the gear ladder (generated by tools/balance/gen_item_stats.py).
-- 1. Cataclysm imports at RequiredLevel 101-130 (entry < 300000, PvE and PvP): stamina, primary stats
--    (with spell power / attack power) and secondary stats capped at the map 750/751 clones' median for
--    the same slot and item level (epics +15%, greens -15%); resilience untouched.
-- 2. Every weapon / armour item above 80 (and the 400000+ clones at 77-80): ratings raised to fill
--    1.0 of a stock WotLK item of the same ladder budget; items with none get two by role;
--    PvP items skipped. Stock 1-80 items are never touched.
-- Each UPDATE checks the old values, so a second run changes nothing. Goes with the GtCombatRatings
-- relief (RATING_COST_SHARE in tools/extend_gt_regen_to_255.py).
-- Apply to acore_world, restart the worldserver; clients need their WDB cache cleared to see it.
-- Revert: Custom/Custom feature SQLs/worlddb/255balance/item_stats_revert_1795506444076819800.sql

-- 52318 Band of Blades (RL 101, ilvl 346, capped stamina/primary/secondary)
